{'symbol': 'HST', 'date': '2022-05-05 16:30:00', 'title': 'HOST HOTELS & RESORTS PROVIDES UPDATED FIRST QUARTER 2022 INVESTOR PRESENTATION', 'text': 'BETHESDA, MD., MAY 05, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HOST HOTELS & RESORTS, INC.\u202f(NASDAQ: HST), THE NATION\'S LARGEST LODGING REAL ESTATE INVESTMENT TRUST (THE "COMPANY"), TODAY PROVIDED AN UPDATED INVESTOR PRESENTATION FOR FIRST QUARTER 2022 RESULTS. THE INVESTOR PRESENTATION CAN BE FOUND ON THE INVESTOR RELATIONS SECTION ON THE COMPANY\'S WEBSITE AT HTTPS://WWW.HOSTHOTELS.COM/INVESTOR-RELATIONS/INVESTOR-PRESENTATION.'}